# `mini serve`; subject 8's first three signed reads (op 5) admitted, the fourth in the window
# refused `rate-limited` naming the retry seconds under NO_RECORD; subject 9 admitted at that
# moment; the exempt sponsor never refused past the limit; after the window subject 8 admitted
# again. One sub-row per check (rate-rows.tsv); the driver names its own red row.
